# Consecrate Land's "can't be enchanted by other Auras" is a rule of the Aura, so it ends when the Aura leaves (CR 303.4,
# 611.3a): Bot2 destroys it with Disenchant, then Utopia Sprawl (Bot2's) enchants Bot1's Forest and stays attached. The Sprawl
# that is cast, resolves and goes to the graveyard instead of entering (CR 303.4i) in the scenarios beside this one is the
# control.

